WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
The boss is amazing

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,080
Can actually get it

3
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,560
A treasure that can fly in the sky and squat on the ground

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,840
money is just a number

5
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:08,420
The real drama is outside the door

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,140
Feizhu is too important and must not be stopped by him

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,060
Boss, thank you for your treasure

8
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,980
I took the first step

9
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:19,730
The personnel first confirms the transaction and exit procedures and cannot catch up.

10
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:24,260
The acceleration of the flying beads is faster than that of this sample during the test

11
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:26,340
May involve flight safety and export controls

12
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,140
Could you please explain the transaction review status?

13
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,460
If there is a problem with the program

14
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,660
Supplementary verification in accordance with the law

15
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,860
The fifth team leader assumes corresponding responsibilities

16
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:35,030
Complete procedures for both parties to the transaction

17
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,140
If export control is involved

18
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:42,880
Please explain the basis in accordance with the law and initiate a review. I will cooperate with the fifth captain.

19
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,140
You can speak with evidence

20
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,020
That thing is put up for public auction

21
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,540
It’s not something you personally allowed before
